      "id": "kpk1-l07-a2-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l07-a2-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Biernik: what you have, like, do"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "After verbs like *mam*, *lubię*, *czytam*, *gotuję* a noun takes the accusative (*biernik*: *kogo? co?*). A feminine noun in *-a* ends in *-ę*, and its adjective in *-ą*: *mam długą listę*. A masculine thing and a neuter noun stay as they are: *mam wolny czas*, *mam sportowe auto*."
      },
      "table": {
        "title": {
          "en": "Biernik"
        },
